+From 529094a95617725d489671de62f2c6dfba0eaaba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: splusesupor-oss <297420272+splusesupor-oss@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 16:27:28 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH] Add permanent watchdog supervisor for the bot
+
+watchdog.py runs main.py as a supervised subprocess and only acts on
+crash / important exception / abnormal stop:
+
+- captures the full traceback and extracts file, line, error type and
+  summary,
+- saves the report under logs/crash_reports and logs/watchdog_reports.jsonl,
+- sends the compact report ONLY to the owner's private chat (owner resolved
+  via the existing modules.owner_check, no hardcoded ids),
+- restarts the bot with exponential backoff and a report cooldown so a
+  crash loop cannot spam the owner,
+- treats clean/graceful stops and normal operation as no-report.
+
+Also adds tests/test_watchdog.py (12 offline tests) plus a
+"python3 watchdog.py --self-test" mode that verifies the owner is the
+only report recipient.
+
+Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
